      "content": "1|#Alive\n2|\n3|Zara is a high ranking member of the [[Ashen Shadow Society]] in [[Stickyickistan]]. As a part of The Council of Shadows, her rank exceeds all other known members of the guild besides The Enigmatic Quartet who's identities remain hidden.",
