      "content": "1|A being of tempestuous laughter and boundless charisma, **Zahur al-Nasira** is more than just a Djinni Prince. He is the **Master of Mayhem**, the **Architect of Anarchy**, and the **Undisputed Host** of the most exhilarating game show in all the multiverse: **The League of Labyrinthia!**\n2|\n3|This one of my (Chase) DM alter egos. I like to imagine I become Zahur when I am behind the  screen. A true chaotic neutral, his domain exists within the plane of [[Limbo]]. A magnificent palace of marble, golden, and lapis lazuli held together by Zahur's will over the chaotic nature of Limbo. He is originally from the inner Elemental Plane of Air.\n4|\n5|![[Limbo_10.webp]]\n6|### **Appearance & Attire**\n7|\n8|Zahur’s form is as mutable as the winds. His body shimmers between solid and ethereal, his deep blue skin streaked with arcs of crackling lightning. His robes, woven from storm clouds and embroidered with golden filigree, billow even when there is no breeze. A crown of swirling mist and gemstones sits atop his head, and his piercing silver eyes gleam with mischief and wisdom.\n9|"
